Illinois QSO Party -- the 102 Illinois counties, each its own multiplier.
Codes and names from the sponsor's county chart (docs/ContestRules/QSOParties/Illinois/IL-QSO-PARTY-Counties.txt); the same 102 codes as DXLog.net's ILQP.txt.
No county maps to the state: the rules count IL counties as multipliers of their own for every entrant.
No INCLUDE here: an out-of-state entrant's table holds only the counties (the host-area rule reads it).
No line of this header may hold an equals sign: the reader takes any such line as an entry.

